* Accumulation-mode MOS varactor cap_nmos_03v3_b wrapper
.subckt aux_amos g w c_width=5e-6 c_length=2e-6 dtemp=0
Ex x 0 g w 1
Rs x y 10
Cs y 0 1p
Bq g w I = (v(x)-v(y))*1e11*(cap_nmos_03v3_b_corner*c_width*c_length)*(0.002458+0.001533*tanh(1.515152*v(g,w)+0.560606))
.ends aux_amos

